issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I tried mavsdk lib to connect to mavlink and [ardupilot](https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot) to simulate the plane and use qgc to display.\nI have connected and sent control commands. I want to send statustext command to display information on `Vehicle Messages` tab on qgc. \ni used the code below to do it, it doesn't give any error but also doesn't display.\n\n```c\nstd::shared_ptr<mavsdk::System> vehicle;\n\nmavsdk::Mavsdk mavsdk{\n    mavsdk::Mavsdk::Configuration{mavsdk::ComponentType::GroundStation}\n};\nmavsdk::ConnectionResult connection_result = mavsdk.add_any_connection(\"udpin://0.0.0.0:14550\");\nvehicle = mavsdk.systems().at(0);\n\n...\n...\n\nvoid send_qgc_message(const std::string& text) {\n    auto passthrough = mavsdk::MavlinkPassthrough{vehicle};\n    mavlink_message_t message;\n    mavlink_statustext_t statustext;\n\n    statustext.severity = MAV_SEVERITY_WARNING; // MAV_SEVERITY_INFO, WARNING, etc.\n    std::strncpy(statustext.text, text.c_str(), sizeof(statustext.text) - 1);\n    statustext.text[sizeof(statustext.text) - 1] = '\\0';\n\n    mavlink_msg_statustext_encode(\n        1,\n        1,\n        &message,\n        &statustext\n    );\n    auto ret = passthrough.send_message(message);\n    if (ret != mavsdk::MavlinkPassthrough::Result::Success) {\n        logger.log(\"Failed to send message\");\n    }\n}\n```\n\n<img width=\"407\" height=\"662\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6b6c34aa-95dd-4dd1-b52b-a9d0c1a8ca78\" />\n\npls help me to do it. Thanks", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_